<title>CHINA: China's Aug bank deposits up 49.1 bln yuan yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China's Aug bank deposits up 49.1 bln yuan yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deposits at China's banks rose by 49.1 billion yuan year-on-year in August, the State Statistical Bureau said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said this year's second cut in interest rates in late August had had little impact. China also cut interest rates last May.</p>
<p>The report gave no other details.</p>
</text>
